<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Junk Case — Cute Phone Cases</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
  <meta name="description" content="Junk Case — pastel, cute phone cases. Shop, gallery, and more.">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <a href="index.html" class="brand">
      <div class="logo">💖</div>
      <div class="brand-text">
        <h1>Junk Case</h1>
        <small>cute phone cases & trinkets</small>
      </div>
    </a>

    <nav class="nav">
      <a href="shop.html">Shop</a>
      <a href="gallery.html">Gallery</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <button id="cart-btn" class="cart-btn">Cart <span id="cart-count">0</span></button>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <h2>Pastel phone cases that spark joy ✨</h2>
      <p>Hand-picked designs — soft pastels, kawaii motifs, and durable protection. Browse the shop or peek at the gallery.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn" href="shop.html">Shop Cases</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="gallery.html">View Gallery</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-image" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1545239351-1141bd82e8a6?q=80&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces" alt="">
    </div>
  </main>

  <section id="about" class="info-cards">
    <article class="card">
      <h3>Quality</h3>
      <p>Durable TPU and shock-absorbent materials that keep your phone safe while staying cute.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h3>Sustainable</h3>
      <p>Eco-conscious packaging and limited-run designs to reduce waste.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h3>Made For You</h3>
      <p>Customizations available — charms, stickers, and layered cases.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <p>© <span id="year"></span> Junk Case • Made with pastel vibes 💕</p>
  </footer>

  <div id="cart-drawer" class="cart-drawer" aria-hidden="true">
    <button id="close-cart" class="close">✕</button>
    <h3>Your Cart</h3>
    <div id="cart-items" class="cart-items"></div>
    <div class="cart-summary">
      <div>Total: <strong id="cart-total">$0.00</strong></div>
      <button id="checkout-btn" class="btn">Checkout</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
